  BiasSupply, BootstrapSupply, BootstrapSwitchReturn, CompensationOutput, CurrentLimitSet, CurrentSense, EnableInput, FeedbackInput, FrequencySet, LowSideGateDrive, RegulatorModeSelect, RegulatorNoConnection, PowerGoodOpenDrain, PowerGround, RegulatorGround, RegulatorSupplyInput, SoftStartProgram, SwitchNode, SynchronizationPort,
